[b]Enclosed architecture[/b]

The later design uses an enclosed shell with connected rooms and a central water return. The concept illustration is an art target; native renders show the implemented geometry.

[SPOILER=Enclosed architecture and art direction]

[i]Prepared native render — The enclosed foundation before the fitted paving and furnishing pass; same prepared camera as the opening overview.[/i]
